{
  "id": "6a7d6a0a5f0dcbf0f7b94889",
  "title": "メンズのヘアスタイルのいろいろ",
  "created": 1786604045,
  "updated": 1786628530,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6a7d6a0e00000000009731ad",
      "text": "メンズのヘアスタイルのいろいろ",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786604046,
      "updated": 1786604050
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d6a0a5f0dcbf0f7b94889",
      "text": " [男性]の[髪型]の類型を調べる",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786604045,
      "updated": 1786614844
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d6a1e00000000009731b1",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786604063,
      "updated": 1786604063
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d6a95000000000072e599",
      "text": "[ベリーショート]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786604182,
      "updated": 1786604185
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7cf9000000000072e686",
      "text": " 字義通りにとても短い",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786608889,
      "updated": 1786609096
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7d1c000000000072e688",
      "text": " 短いが、写真を見たところ[3mmの坊主]とかとは異なる",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786608924,
      "updated": 1786611215
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d85aa000000000072e6d6",
      "text": " ツーブロと同様にサイドや襟足を刈り上げているが、たいていツーブロ(と検索して出てくる写真)より髪が短い",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786611114,
      "updated": 1786611114
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7d5f000000000072e68a",
      "text": " ツーブロと違って髪の長さは二分されておらず、サイドからトップに向かって長さがグラデーションで遷移してる用に見える",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786608992,
      "updated": 1786611238
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7cfa000000000072e687",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786608890,
      "updated": 1786608890
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d6c7f000000000072e5c3",
      "text": "[アップバングショート]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786604671,
      "updated": 1786612169
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d89c9000000000072e6fe",
      "text": " bangとはアメリカ英語で前髪のこと[. https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bangs_(hair)]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786612169,
      "updated": 1786612237
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d8a0d000000000072e700",
      "text": " 前髪を上げたショートヘア",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786612237,
      "updated": 1786612243
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d89ca000000000072e6ff",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786612170,
      "updated": 1786612170
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d6bb7000000000072e5bb",
      "text": "[フェードカット]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786604472,
      "updated": 1786604474
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d8645000000000072e6d7",
      "text": " fade in/outのfade",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786611270,
      "updated": 1786611643
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d864d000000000072e6d8",
      "text": " 上に行くほど徐々に長さを残す、グラデーション状に濃くしていく",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786611277,
      "updated": 1786611314
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d86bf000000000072e6db",
      "text": " どこに注目してフェードと言っているのかな",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786611391,
      "updated": 1786611464
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d86f3000000000072e6dc",
      "text": "  髪の長さの遷移を言っているのか、",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786611443,
      "updated": 1786611446
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d86f5000000000072e6dd",
      "text": "  色合い(地肌~髪)のグラデーションを言っているのか、どっちかな",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786611446,
      "updated": 1786611473
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d86f9000000000072e6de",
      "text": "  どっちもかな",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786611449,
      "updated": 1786611451
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d8995000000000072e6fc",
      "text": " [wiki how https://www.wikihow.com/Types-of-Fades]の記事でいろんなフェードカットが紹介されている",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786612118,
      "updated": 1786612125
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d899d000000000072e6fd",
      "text": "  長さのバリエーションである[Low fade], [Mid fade], [High fade]と、その他のいろんなバリエーション",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786612125,
      "updated": 1786612158
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7cf7000000000072e685",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786608887,
      "updated": 1786608887
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d6a98000000000072e59a",
      "text": "[ツーブロック]([ツーブロ])",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786604185,
      "updated": 1786604602
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7cbe000000000072e682",
      "text": " サイドやバックの刈り上げた短い髪の部分と、頭頂部や耳の上の長い髪の部分で、2つのブロックがあるもの [. https://gurubi.ac.jp/glossary/%E3%83%84%E3%83%BC%E3%83%96%E3%83%AD%E3%83%83%E3%82%AF/]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786608831,
      "updated": 1786608885
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7cbe000000000072e683",
      "text": " 長さの意味は字義に含まれていさそう",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786608831,
      "updated": 1786609094
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7db3000000000072e68e",
      "text": "  たいてい写真ではベリーショートより長い",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786609075,
      "updated": 1786609080
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d8a68000000000072e701",
      "text": " 高校の同じクラスにいた格好いい人間がこの髪型をやっていたような。長めで、サイドと襟足が刈り込まれていた [vlzs.icon]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786612328,
      "updated": 1786612372
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7da9000000000072e68d",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786609066,
      "updated": 1786609066
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d6bf9000000000072e5bf",
      "text": "[スパイキーショート]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786604538,
      "updated": 1786604539
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d8851000000000072e6eb",
      "text": " 尖ってる！",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786611794,
      "updated": 1786611796
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7cba000000000072e681",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786608827,
      "updated": 1786608827
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7b62000000000072e667",
      "text": "[カルマヘア]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786608482,
      "updated": 1786608827
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7b64000000000072e669",
      "text": " おでこが見えることから来る爽やかさと清潔感がある[. https://beauty.hotpepper.jp/magazine/283137/]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786608484,
      "updated": 1786608616
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7be9000000000072e66f",
      "text": "  たしかに清潔な感じがする",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786608617,
      "updated": 1786608631
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7b64000000000072e66a",
      "text": " おでこが見えるということは眉毛も整えるものだ",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786608484,
      "updated": 1786608638
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7b64000000000072e66b",
      "text": " カルマヘアの髪型の写真はかっこいい人が多い",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786608484,
      "updated": 1786608643
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d918b0000000000b9db39",
      "text": " 真ん中でわけると[センターパート]という髪型",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786614156,
      "updated": 1786614167
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7cba000000000072e680",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786608826,
      "updated": 1786608826
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d6c84000000000072e5c4",
      "text": "[マッシュ]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786604676,
      "updated": 1786608826
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d6d53000000000072e5ce",
      "text": " [メンズマッシュ]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786604883,
      "updated": 1786604887
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d6c99000000000072e5c5",
      "text": " [ショートマッシュ]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786604698,
      "updated": 1786604891
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d6d5a000000000072e5d2",
      "text": " サイド(もみあげ)や襟足(首元)が刈り込まれているから涼しそう～[vlzs.icon]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786604891,
      "updated": 1786608818
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d6dc7000000000072e5d8",
      "text": "  もみあげをサイド、首元の髪を襟足と呼ぶんだ[. http://www.famille.tokyo.jp/blog/2017/05/post-101-468045.html]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786604999,
      "updated": 1786612922
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d8cba000000000072e731",
      "text": " 眉毛を整えなくて良さそう……楽そう……[vlzs.icon]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786612922,
      "updated": 1786612934
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d8cc6000000000072e732",
      "text": "  楽そうというか、過去に、別用途のカミソリで剃ってみたら剃り跡の肌が青くて目立って、嫌だった気がする",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786612935,
      "updated": 1786613081
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7cb6000000000072e67e",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786608822,
      "updated": 1786608822
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d6d72000000000072e5d4",
      "text": "[ウルフカット]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786604914,
      "updated": 1786605422
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7b12000000000072e661",
      "text": " 襟足が長い",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786608402,
      "updated": 1786608411
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7c0a000000000072e67c",
      "text": " 清潔感を出すのが難しそう",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786608650,
      "updated": 1786608664
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d8821000000000072e6ea",
      "text": "  でも写真の方たちを見ているとウルフカットであっても清潔そうに見える",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786611745,
      "updated": 1786611762
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7cb8000000000072e67f",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786608825,
      "updated": 1786608825
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d8ba0000000000072e71e",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786612640,
      "updated": 1786612640
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d6fd3000000000072e5ed",
      "text": "[七三分け]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786605523,
      "updated": 1786605529
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d6b77000000000072e5ac",
      "text": "[丸刈り]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786604408,
      "updated": 1786604661
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d6ae4000000000072e5a0",
      "text": "[スポーツ刈り]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786604260,
      "updated": 1786604280
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d6b9c000000000072e5b7",
      "text": "[モヒカン]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786604445,
      "updated": 1786604445
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d6b99000000000072e5b1",
      "text": "[アフロ]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786604442,
      "updated": 1786604442
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d6b9b000000000072e5b5",
      "text": "[ドレッドヘア]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786604443,
      "updated": 1786604443
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d802c00000000006237dd",
      "text": "[ブレイズヘア]",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1786609709,
      "updated": 1786609743
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d804900000000006237de",
      "text": "[コーンロウ]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786609738,
      "updated": 1786612675
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d8bc5000000000072e722",
      "text": "[ソフトモヒカン]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786612677,
      "updated": 1786612677
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d8bc5000000000072e723",
      "text": "[ハードモヒカン]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786612677,
      "updated": 1786612677
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d8bc5000000000072e724",
      "text": "[リーゼント]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786612677,
      "updated": 1786612677
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d8bc6000000000072e725",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786612678,
      "updated": 1786612678
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d6a1f00000000009731b3",
      "text": "必要としているもの",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786604064,
      "updated": 1786608089
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d6a3100000000009731b5",
      "text": " 清潔な髪型。不潔ではなくしたい",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786604081,
      "updated": 1786608087
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d6bd1000000000072e5bc",
      "text": "  眉毛を整えることを省いて避けたいけれど、短髪(清潔でこれが良い)でそれは難しいのかな",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786604498,
      "updated": 1786605273
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d6ed9000000000072e5e4",
      "text": "   ショートマッシュなら眉毛が見えなさそう",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786605274,
      "updated": 1786605335
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d6eee000000000072e5e5",
      "text": " 自分の顔の雰囲気から逸脱しない髪型",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786605295,
      "updated": 1786608091
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d6efa000000000072e5e7",
      "text": " 年齢相応の髪型",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786605307,
      "updated": 1786608093
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d8ac6000000000072e704",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786612423,
      "updated": 1786612423
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d79de000000000072e64f",
      "text": "予定",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786608094,
      "updated": 1786612702
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d8aab000000000072e702",
      "text": " [ショートマッシュ]→[ツーブロック]→[フェードカット]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786612395,
      "updated": 1786612844
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7dc9a70000000000f808bd",
      "text": "  ショートマッシュは他の髪型と比べて冒険が少なく、心のハードルというか段差が小さい",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786628519,
      "updated": 1786628523
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7dc9a70000000000f808bf",
      "text": "   この長さにカットするとき、他の髪型も試せそう",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786628519,
      "updated": 1786628525
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7dc9a70000000000f808c0",
      "text": "    アレンジできそう。カルマヘア、トランクスヘア、センターパートなどがてきそう",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786628519,
      "updated": 1786628530
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d8adf000000000072e706",
      "text": " 冒険が少ないかも",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786612448,
      "updated": 1786612450
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d8ac2000000000072e703",
      "text": "  道具(前髪に癖を付ける)を使わず、",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786612419,
      "updated": 1786612450
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d8aec000000000072e709",
      "text": "   カルマヘアなど",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786612461,
      "updated": 1786612462
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d6ed4000000000072e5e3",
      "text": "  未体験の整髪料を使わず、",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786605269,
      "updated": 1786612534
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d8afc000000000072e70c",
      "text": "   水に濡れたような髪とか",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786612530,
      "updated": 1786612530
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d8b03000000000072e70d",
      "text": "   尖った[スパイキーショート]や",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786612483,
      "updated": 1786612747
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d8b2d000000000072e716",
      "text": "  [- 眉毛を整える髪型を避けており]、新しいことを試せてない",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786612526,
      "updated": 1786612583
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d8b2d000000000072e717",
      "text": "   [- おでこの見える髪型は眉毛を整える必要があり避けてる]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786612526,
      "updated": 1786612563
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d8b4b000000000072e71a",
      "text": "   ツーブロックとフェードカットで整えなきゃいけないじゃん",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786612555,
      "updated": 1786612771
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d8c22000000000072e727",
      "text": " 冒険ならヘアカラー?染髪?髪染め?脱色?とかをしたらいいのかな",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786612771,
      "updated": 1786612795
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d8c3b000000000072e728",
      "text": "  大丈夫かな",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786612795,
      "updated": 1786612805
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d8c45000000000072e729",
      "text": "  地肌や今後の髪質に影響があって、以降はツルツルの髪が利用できなくなるということはないかな",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786612805,
      "updated": 1786612836
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d8c12000000000072e726",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786612755,
      "updated": 1786612755
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d8af0000000000072e70b",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786612464,
      "updated": 1786612464
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d6ca3000000000072e5c6",
      "text": "男性のヘアスタイルの写真を見ていると、k女性がする髪のようにチュルンチュルンにしていることが少ない",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786604708,
      "updated": 1786613100
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7dd6000000000072e68f",
      "text": " かっこいい男性の長めの髪型を見ていると、頭頂部に光の輪があるようなツルツルではない",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786609110,
      "updated": 1786613108
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7e17000000000072e690",
      "text": " 光を一様に返すツルツルというより、向きがあちこちに向いた髪で光を拡散してつや消しになっているような感じ",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786609175,
      "updated": 1786609175
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d8b8e000000000072e71d",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786612623,
      "updated": 1786612623
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d6ca3000000000072e5c7",
      "text": "燃える炎みたいな、スパイクのような形にまとまった髪がいくつもある髪型はどう作られているんだ",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786604708,
      "updated": 1786604858
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7e2e000000000072e692",
      "text": " 一本一本を指でねじって作っているのかな……でも鏡の前でつねっている様子は想像できない。異なりそう",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786609198,
      "updated": 1786612602
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7e48000000000072e695",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786609224,
      "updated": 1786609224
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d79bc000000000072e64d",
      "text": "水に濡れたような質感はどう作られているんだ",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786608060,
      "updated": 1786608068
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7e52000000000072e697",
      "text": " そういう液剤がある？",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786609234,
      "updated": 1786609242
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7e52000000000072e698",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786609234,
      "updated": 1786609234
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d6d3a000000000072e5cd",
      "text": "何が似合うか/似合わないか自分ではわからないし、若い男性っぽい髪型を転々としていけばいいか",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786604858,
      "updated": 1786606263
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7e5b000000000072e699",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786609244,
      "updated": 1786609244
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d6bff000000000072e5c0",
      "text": "自分はネットで検索してみているけど、身だしなみに気をつけている人は、男性ファッション誌から知りそうなイメージがある",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786604544,
      "updated": 1786612724
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d6b7f000000000072e5ad",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786604416,
      "updated": 1786604416
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7941000000000072e648",
      "text": "ダウンパーマ薬剤を使って作られる髪型のいろいろ",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786607937,
      "updated": 1786607951
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d794f000000000072e64a",
      "text": " https://www.beautygarage.jp/staff-recommend/image-detail/38001292",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786607951,
      "updated": 1786607959
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7950000000000072e64b",
      "text": "  [「ダウンパーマで作るおすすめメンズヘア」という画像]で6つ紹介される",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786607952,
      "updated": 1786608019
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d91b20000000000b9db41",
      "text": "   カルマヘア",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786614195,
      "updated": 1786614201
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d91b20000000000b9db40",
      "text": "   [ガイルヘア]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786614194,
      "updated": 1786614194
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d91ad0000000000b9db3f",
      "text": "   [アイビーカット]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786614189,
      "updated": 1786614189
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d91ba0000000000b9db42",
      "text": "    聞き覚えがある",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786614203,
      "updated": 1786614221
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d91a40000000000b9db3e",
      "text": "   [シースルーマッシュ]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786614181,
      "updated": 1786614185
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d91760000000000b9db38",
      "text": "   [センターパートウルフ]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786614134,
      "updated": 1786614175
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d91730000000000b9db36",
      "text": "   [シャドウパーマ]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786614175,
      "updated": 1786614175
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d88ce000000000072e6f8",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786611918,
      "updated": 1786611918
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d88d0000000000072e6fa",
      "text": "おでこを出す/おでこを出さない",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786611920,
      "updated": 1786612869
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d8c85000000000072e72b",
      "text": "刈り上げる/刈り上げない",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786612869,
      "updated": 1786612886
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d8c8d000000000072e72d",
      "text": "襟足を伸ばす/伸ばさない",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786612877,
      "updated": 1786612888
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d8da9000000000072e735",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786613161,
      "updated": 1786613161
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d8d97000000000072e734",
      "text": "もみあげは常に短くされるみたい",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786613143,
      "updated": 1786613171
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d8dab000000000072e736",
      "text": " ヘアスタイルの写真の人にはもみあげが見つからない事が多い",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786613163,
      "updated": 1786613190
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d8c9d000000000072e72f",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786612894,
      "updated": 1786612894
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d88cf000000000072e6f9",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786611919,
      "updated": 1786611919
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d88cd000000000072e6f6",
      "text": "実際の男性の服装コーディネートの写真などから髪型の名前を当てて、ヘアスタイルの見分けを強めたい",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786611917,
      "updated": 1786611985
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7941000000000072e649",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786607937,
      "updated": 1786607937
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d6cb3000000000072e5c8",
      "text": "実在?する人を見て髪型の名前を当ててみる",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786604723,
      "updated": 1786611905
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d6cd4000000000072e5ca",
      "text": " [マッシュル]の[マッシュバーンデッド]さん[. https://mashle.pw/character/]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786604757,
      "updated": 1786605180
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d6eba000000000072e5e2",
      "text": "  [マッシュ]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786605243,
      "updated": 1786605244
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d6e7a000000000072e5dd",
      "text": "  襟足は短く切られているが、刈り込みの質感はない",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786605179,
      "updated": 1786605212
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d6e9c000000000072e5e0",
      "text": "  サイドは刈り込まれたような長さだが、刈り込みの質感はない",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786605212,
      "updated": 1786605238
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d74c4000000000072e601",
      "text": " [五条悟][. https://times.abema.tv/articles/-/8638921]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786606789,
      "updated": 1786606797
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d74c9000000000072e603",
      "text": "  長い髪でピンピンしてる",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786606793,
      "updated": 1786606842
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d74fa000000000072e604",
      "text": "  サイドは地肌部分がおそらく刈り込まれており、上から伸びてる髪がかかっている",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786606842,
      "updated": 1786611970
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d74fc000000000072e607",
      "text": "  襟足は刈り上げてるみたい",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786606844,
      "updated": 1786606859
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d8890000000000072e6ec",
      "text": " [爆豪]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786611857,
      "updated": 1786611866
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d88a6000000000072e6f0",
      "text": "  尖った感じが、[スパイキーショート][. https://minx-net.co.jp/styling/6723]の髪型と似てるが、より長いように見える",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786611878,
      "updated": 1786611958
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d6eb5000000000072e5e1",
      "text": " [Henry Lau]さん",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786605238,
      "updated": 1786605568
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7001000000000072e5ee",
      "text": "  違った、探しているのはこの人でなくてどなただっけ",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786605569,
      "updated": 1786605700
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d701d000000000072e5ef",
      "text": " [Travis Stewart]([Machinedrum])",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786605598,
      "updated": 1786606389
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7338000000000072e5f4",
      "text": "  https://datatransmission.co/blog/festival-chat-machinedrum-field-day/ の赤いネックレスを付けた長髪の画像",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786606393,
      "updated": 1786606422
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7362000000000072e5f9",
      "text": "   かっこいい",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786606434,
      "updated": 1786606434
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7336000000000072e5f3",
      "text": "   コンピューターナードな雰囲気だ",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786606391,
      "updated": 1786606515
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d735e000000000072e5f5",
      "text": "  https://www.insomniac.com/music/artists/machinedrum/  の真ん中で髪を分けた長髪",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786606430,
      "updated": 1786606553
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d73e0000000000072e5fc",
      "text": "   アーティストの写真といった感じ",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786606560,
      "updated": 1786606574
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d73ee000000000072e5fd",
      "text": "  https://www.beatportal.com/playlists/1428905-playlist-of-the-week-machinedrum の冒頭の画像",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786606574,
      "updated": 1786606748
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7488000000000072e600",
      "text": "   [Machinedrum - BOUNCE N SLIDE]のYoutube動画のサムネイル画像になってる",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786606729,
      "updated": 1786607075
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d75f2000000000072e619",
      "text": "   撮影前にヘアメイクをプロの方が行ったという感じ",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786607090,
      "updated": 1786607090
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d75f1000000000072e617",
      "text": "   すべてのの写真のなかで一番清潔感を感じるなあ",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786607089,
      "updated": 1786607125
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7540000000000072e60d",
      "text": "  https://musictech.com/features/interviews/machinedrum-travis-stewart-demoscene-tracker-3for82/ の画像",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786606912,
      "updated": 1786606921
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7548000000000072e60f",
      "text": "   サイドがだいぶ刈り込まれてる",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786606921,
      "updated": 1786606955
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7567000000000072e610",
      "text": "   頭頂部一体に髪がある",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786606952,
      "updated": 1786606973
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7571000000000072e612",
      "text": "   後ろはどうなってるかわからない",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786606961,
      "updated": 1786606961
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d75eb000000000072e616",
      "text": "   普段からこの髪型で過ごされていそうな感じ",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786607083,
      "updated": 1786607139
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d76b3000000000072e61c",
      "text": "  [Machinedrum Boiler Room NY Live Set https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pyk6nSwVfNY]ではべっちゃりしている",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786607284,
      "updated": 1786607307
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7335000000000072e5f2",
      "text": "  [2012年のTaicoclubの動画 https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=D6s_hHUGwd4]ではさらに長い長髪で汗も書いていそうなのに、かっこよく見えるな",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786606390,
      "updated": 1786607316
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d765b000000000072e61a",
      "text": "   [- [GBYE]を好んで聞いていたことがあるから[ハロー効果]かも？ 曲がかっこいいので鳴らしている人もかっこいい]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786607196,
      "updated": 1786607375
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d76f2000000000072e620",
      "text": "   [十分に髪の量が多いと汗を書いてもべちゃっとしては見えない]のかも",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786607346,
      "updated": 1786607411
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d771c000000000072e621",
      "text": "   Boiler Roomのほうはこちらの動画より髪の量が少なくて不十分なのかな",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786607389,
      "updated": 1786607443
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d77dc000000000072e638",
      "text": " [レオナルド・ディカプリオ]さん(ウルフ・オブ・ウォールストリートの) ",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786607580,
      "updated": 1786607592
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d77e8000000000072e63a",
      "text": "  ポマードで撫でつけたような髪型",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786607592,
      "updated": 1786609544
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7f88000000000072e6b1",
      "text": "  でも油っぽい感じはしないな",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786609544,
      "updated": 1786609554
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7734000000000072e622",
      "text": "  片側にある髪をもう片側に向かって撫でつけたような",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786607412,
      "updated": 1786607627
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d77fa000000000072e63b",
      "text": "  [オールバック]ではない、なんと言うんだこの髪型は",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786607610,
      "updated": 1786607667
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7823000000000072e63c",
      "text": " https://www.instagram.com/p/C_2sh-3vsIZ/",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786607652,
      "updated": 1786607686
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7845000000000072e63e",
      "text": "  こんな髪型もあるんだ",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786607686,
      "updated": 1786607689
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7845000000000072e63d",
      "text": "  髪の癖、前髪の立ち上がりをつけるのには[スポットパーマ]というのを使うんだ",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786607686,
      "updated": 1786607726
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d786e000000000072e640",
      "text": "   これってコテとかヘアアイロンのこと？",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786607726,
      "updated": 1786607750
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d78a2000000000072e646",
      "text": "  [スポットパーマで検索 https://www.google.com/search?q=スポットパーマ]すると前髪が立ち上がった髪型がたくさん表示された",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786607778,
      "updated": 1786607806
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d78be000000000072e647",
      "text": "   [「ダウンパーマで作るおすすめメンズヘア」という画像]の[カルマヘア]みたいな形が多い",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786607806,
      "updated": 1786608041
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7885000000000072e641",
      "text": "   へー[トランクス]さんの髪型なので[トランクスヘア]とも呼ばれるんだ",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786607750,
      "updated": 1786608168
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7a28000000000072e653",
      "text": "    ほんとうだ似てる→ [. https://hidehair.jp/hairstyle-trunks]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786608168,
      "updated": 1786608178
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7f40000000000072e6a9",
      "text": " [Tilian Pearson](4ピースバンドの[Dance Gavin Dance]のボーカリストの方)",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786609472,
      "updated": 1786609499
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d8f52000000000072e74a",
      "text": "  髪を垂らしてる",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786613587,
      "updated": 1786613592
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d8f5e000000000072e74b",
      "text": "   [トランクスヘアの作り方]の[shun___fukuda]さんの動画みたいにしてるのかな",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786613599,
      "updated": 1786613627
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d8f7a000000000072e74d",
      "text": "    液剤を吹き付けて、",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786613627,
      "updated": 1786613628
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7f01000000000072e6a3",
      "text": " [ジョージ-メンズコーチ-] ",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786609410,
      "updated": 1786609412
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7f0c000000000072e6a8",
      "text": "  Youtubeチャンネルのアイコン画像を見る [. https://www.youtube.com/@coachjoji]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786609420,
      "updated": 1786609426
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7e8a000000000072e69c",
      "text": "  サイドを刈り上げていて、頭頂部に短くない髪がある",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786609291,
      "updated": 1786609319
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7ea8000000000072e69d",
      "text": "  ツーブロではない",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786609320,
      "updated": 1786609330
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7eb2000000000072e69e",
      "text": "   サイドから頭頂部はグラデーションになっている、2つの別々な髪の長さがあるのでない",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786609330,
      "updated": 1786609349
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7f5f000000000072e6b0",
      "text": "  [Tilian Pearson]さんと同様に、おでこの前で片側からもう片側に向かって垂らし、撫でつけている",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786609503,
      "updated": 1786609534
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7ad4000000000072e65c",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786608341,
      "updated": 1786608341
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7a01000000000072e651",
      "text": "[カルマヘア]と[センターパート]と[コンマヘア]って似てる [. https://nexus.salon/blog/23813/]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786608129,
      "updated": 1786608340
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7a74000000000072e657",
      "text": " [カルマヘア]の特に真ん中で分けているものが[センターパート]なんだ",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786608244,
      "updated": 1786608340
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7ac6000000000072e65a",
      "text": "  カルマってどういう意味？",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786608326,
      "updated": 1786608340
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7ac5000000000072e659",
      "text": "   韓国語で「カルマ」が「分け目」という意味",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786608325,
      "updated": 1786608340
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7ac9000000000072e65b",
      "text": "  分け目のある髪型ということなんだ",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786608330,
      "updated": 1786608358
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7b27000000000072e663",
      "text": " コンマヘアは毛先が、`,`(コンマ)の字形のように顔の中心に向かってカールするもので、",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786608423,
      "updated": 1786608565
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7baf000000000072e66e",
      "text": "  カルマヘアで毛足を後ろに流そうとするのとは逆",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786608559,
      "updated": 1786608577
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d7b90000000000072e66c",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786608528,
      "updated": 1786608528
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d8734000000000072e6e2",
      "text": "[ベリーショート]と[フェードカット]が似てる",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786611509,
      "updated": 1786611630
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d873d000000000072e6e4",
      "text": " 写真を見てもあまり違いがわからない",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786611517,
      "updated": 1786611522
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d8742000000000072e6e5",
      "text": " 言葉が注目している対象の違いかな",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786611523,
      "updated": 1786611547
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d875a000000000072e6e7",
      "text": "  ベリーショート(とても短い)",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786611547,
      "updated": 1786611553
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d8761000000000072e6e8",
      "text": "  フェードカット(髪の長さが?色合いが?fadeする、徐々に消える)",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786611553,
      "updated": 1786611588
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d8735000000000072e6e3",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786611509,
      "updated": 1786611627
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d8792000000000072e6e9",
      "text": "[トランクスヘアの作り方]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786611603,
      "updated": 1786613595
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d8e7e000000000072e73f",
      "text": " https://www.instagram.com/reel/DFfbg4UPI89",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786613374,
      "updated": 1786613378
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d8e93000000000072e742",
      "text": " [shun___fukuda]さんのinstagramの動画",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786613395,
      "updated": 1786613395
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d8e7a000000000072e73e",
      "text": " カルマヘアに追加して、前に落とす髪を作ってる",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786613370,
      "updated": 1786613414
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d8ea6000000000072e744",
      "text": " 髪に吹き付けているものは、どういうものなんだろう",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786613414,
      "updated": 1786613442
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d8ebf000000000072e746",
      "text": " ドライヤーと[ロールブラシ]と、この吹き付けているもの(髪型を固定させるもの？)のみで作るなら、自分にも用意できそう",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786613439,
      "updated": 1786613561
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d8efe000000000072e749",
      "text": "  似合わな……似合……どうなるかわからないものとしてやろう",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786613502,
      "updated": 1786613575
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7d8ef9000000000072e748",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1786613498,
      "updated": 1786613498
    }
  ]
}